<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: #000;
        }

        .page {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 40px 60px;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: relative;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .info {
            font-size: 12pt;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .columns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .column {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .text-block {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .text-block p {
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        }

        .indent {
            margin-left: 30px;
        }

        .center {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 120px;
            background: #f8f8f8;
            border: 1px dashed #999;
            margin: 15px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }

        @media print {
            body { padding: 0; }
            .page { margin: 0; box-shadow: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="title">Sample Document Title</div>
            <div class="subtitle">Subtitle or Tagline Here</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Info block -->
        <div class="info">
            <p><strong>Date:</strong> August 1, 2026</p>
            <p><strong>Author:</strong> Grok</p>
            <p><strong>Classification:</strong> Public</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Two-column layout -->
        <div class="columns">
            <!-- Left column -->
            <div class="column">
                <div class="text-block">
                    <p>This is the first paragraph in the left column. It continues with normal text flow and is intended to demonstrate the exact spatial layout of multiple columns as they would appear in the original document image.</p>
                    <p class="indent">Indented continuation of the paragraph for proper alignment.</p>
                    <p>This paragraph sits directly below the first one with standard spacing.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right column -->
            <div class="column">
                <div class="text-block">
                    <p>This is the first paragraph in the right column. It continues with normal text flow and is intended to demonstrate the exact spatial layout of multiple columns as they would appear in the original document image.</p>
                    <p class="indent">Indented continuation of the paragraph for proper alignment.</p>
                    <p>This paragraph sits directly below the first one with standard spacing.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Centered text block -->
        <div class="text-block center">
            <p>This text block is centered horizontally across the entire width of the page, matching the visual positioning seen in the source layout.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Placeholder for non-text element (e.g., chart or diagram) -->
        <div class="text-block">
            <div class="placeholder">[Chart: left-aligned with caption below]</div>
            <p style="text-align: left; font-style: italic; color: #666;">[Chart: centered diagram placeholder]</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Table example -->
        <div class="text-block">
            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px;">Cell 1, Row 1</td>
                    <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px;">Cell 2, Row 1</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px;">Cell 1, Row 2</td>
                    <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px;">Cell 2, Row 2</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- List example -->
        <div class="text-block">
            <ul style="margin-left: 30px;">
                <li>First list item with proper indentation</li>
                <li>Second list item with proper indentation</li>
                <li>Third list item with proper indentation</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Math example -->
        <div class="text-block center">
            <p>Inline math: \( E = mc^2 \)</p>
            <p>Display math:</p>
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 15px 0;">
                $$ a^2 + b^2 = c^2 $$
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>End of document – Page 1 of 1</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
